    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχρίω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anoint</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλείμμασιν ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Duris
					10
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.117
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ὀφθαλμούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					3.18
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψευδηγόροις φήμαις ἐγχρίειν ἔπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1455
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>anoint oneself</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					15.1.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὸ πρόσωπον</span>
				Nic.Dam.<i><span class="en">
				p.2
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.21.20
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.526
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sting, prick</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					251d
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰὸς ἐγχρισθείς</span>
			poison <i>injected by a sting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				1.54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stick in</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κέντρον</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				6.20
			</span></i>.</div>
